  "body": "Enjoy the best of coastal living in beautiful Red Beach, within easy walking distance of the beach, local playground and bus stop. Red Beach School is also nearby, while convenient motorway access makes commuting to Auckland easy. Silverdale offers excellent shopping and vibrant Orewa is just a short drive away, with its beautiful beach, shops, restaurants and cafes.\r\n\r\nBuilt in the 1980's and still going strong! This three-bedroom home is a little gem with plenty life in it but still has plenty of potential for improvements. Like a charming older lady, she may need a little TLC to bring out her best, but the opportunity is here to polish her up beautifully!\r\n\r\nSet on a generous half-share section with its own drive, the property is in good working order and offers space for additional off-street parking. There is a large single garage with room for a workshop - perfect for those who enjoy a little extra space for projects or hobbies.\r\n\r\nAnd the cherry on top? Distant sea views!\r\n\r\nWhether you are a first-home buyer, investor, upsizing or downsizing, this property is well worth your attention. Enjoy it as it is, explore the potential to modernise, and make it your own.\r\n\r\nVacant possession means you could be settled in before Christmas!\r\n\r\nLocation, location, location - the golden rule of real estate. Add affordability and exciting potential, and this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nCome along and see the potential for yourself. I look forward to meeting you!",
